The main bus stop is there.
I stand there.
Suddenly a bus comes.
I get on that bus.
This bus goes to the city.
I get a seat near the window.
I look outside through the window.
The bus goes straight forward.
There are plenty of small shops outside.
I see new big buildings.
There is a big rush on the road.
The bus reaches a big junction.
From there, the bus turns right.
I see new people on the way.
Kochi is a very big city.
I really like this journey.
